/Title (Libraries used: NumPy \(array mathematics and least squares\); SciPy \(distances/Voronoi\); scikit- learn \(library verification, stratification, standardisation, clustering, logistic regression, mutual information and generated crescent data\); pandas \(tables\); Matplotlib \(figures\); python-docx \(editable report\). Documentation: https://numpy.org/doc/ ; https://scikit-learn.org/stable/ ; https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/ . AI assistance was used to develop and review the written explanations, Python implementation and report formatting. All numerical results presented here correspond to executable code and attached raw outputs; the reader should be prepared to explain and reproduce them during assessment verification.)
