/Title (Python and NumPy, SciPy, pandas, scikit-learn and Matplotlib were used. Data records required by Q2, Q3 and Q4 were produced by deterministic generators specified with exact seeds and partition rules. Seed 17 is the primary Q2 dataset; seeds 17, 29 and 41 support repetition. The 1,000-record Q2 datasets use stratified splits of 600 training, 200 validation and 200 test samples. Validation selects configurations; each final test result is measured once after the choice is frozen.)
